{"i":504,"type":"whisper","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","from":"Cole","to":"Eli","text":"Our pact holds. Ash's map is shaky; stay steady."}
{"i":505,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Eli","text":"Cole and I have a pact, but Hana is a threat. I'll offer Hana as insurance, but keep Cole close. Jury sees pragmatism, not betrayal yet."}
